{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03820","headline":"咏琴 · 刘允济","name":"咏琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔在龙门侧，谁想凤鸣时。\n雕琢今爲器，宫商不自持。\n巴人缓疎节，楚客弄繁丝。\n欲作高张引，飜成下调悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘允济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}